{"sections":{"1650337142b3782430":{"type":"apps","disabled":true,"settings":{}},"main":{"type":"product-template-3","blocks":{"3dcf35f2-b0e9-4c1e-888b-745fc27d4b11":{"type":"html","disabled":true,"settings":{"setwidthcontent":"container","content_html":"<div id=\"accordion\" class=\"nav-tab-info-vertical\">\n<div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"card-header shipping-info\">\n        <a class=\"card-link collapsed\" data-toggle=\"collapse\" data-target=\"#collapseOne1\" href=\"#\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n            fit &amp; care<i class=\"icon-arrow-right icon-right\"></i>\n        </a>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"collapseOne1\" class=\"collapse\" data-parent=\"#accordion\" style=\"\">\n        <div class=\"card-body px-0\">\n<p>For the greatest comfort, we recommend wearing your new Vionic footwear for just a few hours for the first few days to allow your feet to adjust to the new level of orthotic comfort and support.</p>\n<p>Within one to two weeks you should find the product completely comfortable and supportive.</p>\n\n<ul>\n<li>To preserve the appearance of your Vionic shoes, we recommend that you clean, if needed, using a dry, cotton cloth to wipe away dirt or dust.</li>\n<li>Keep footwear away from direct heat to prevent from drying out. If your shoes become wet, please allow them to dry naturally.</li>\n<li>We recommend that you test any cleaning product by applying a small amount to a discreet area and allowing it to dry. Do not use cleaners which contain acid or detergents, as they may damage and prematurely age the leather.</li>\n</ul>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n</div>\n</div>"}},"ed72f237-4e8a-48f0-a50a-c4b96884bf64":{"type":"html","disabled":true,"settings":{"setwidthcontent":"container","content_html":"<div class=\"product-addtnl-desc\">\n  <h1>what makes vionic shoes different</h1>\n  <div class=\"product-addtnl-desc-images\">\n  \t<img class=\"image-1\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0553/5590/0092/files/30day.jpg?v=1645410568\